<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:72px">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h1 style="color:var(--white)">Find work around WA without paying for leads</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;max-width:480px">Looking at jobs and quoting is free. If you win the job, we take <%= feePercent %>% when the customer releases payment.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn big" href="/signup?as=tradie">Join free</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="sum">
        <div><span class="label-col">Quote</span><span><%= money(350000) %></span></div>
        <div><span class="label-col">Paid for leads</span><span><%= money(0) %></span></div>
        <div><span class="label-col">Our fee (<%= feePercent %>%)</span><span>&minus;<%= money(feeFor(350000)) %></span></div>
        <div><span>You get</span><span><%= money(350000 - feeFor(350000)) %></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap narrow page doc">
  <%- include('../partials/photo', { photo: 'plumber', cls: 'wide' }) %>
  <h2>How you get paid</h2>
  <p>The customer pays when they accept your quote, before you start. You'll see it on the job page, so you know the money's there before you buy materials or book the day.</p>
  <p>When they sign the job off, the payment goes to your bank through Stripe, usually within 2 business days. You don't have to chase an invoice.</p>

  <h2>Who you're up against</h2>
  <p>Everyone quoting has a checked ABN and current insurance. Reviews only come from customers who've paid through us.</p>

  <h2>Signing up</h2>
  <p>It takes about 10 minutes. You'll need your ABN, your licence number if your trade needs one, and your public liability insurer and expiry date. We check you over, usually within a business day. Then connect your bank through Stripe and you can start quoting.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq" style="margin-top:16px">
    <% faqs.forEach(([question, answer]) => { %>
      <details>
        <summary><%= question %></summary>
        <p><%= answer %></p>
      </details>
    <% }) %>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top:40px"><a class="btn accent big" href="/signup?as=tradie">Join free</a></p>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
